00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:50.340
<u>If that little door of the cabin opens up,</u>

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:50.340
Moshimo chiisana koya no to ga aitara

00:24:50.570 --> 00:24:54.520
<u>Wait and see</u>

00:24:50.570 --> 00:24:54.520
Mattete goran

00:24:54.800 --> 00:24:59.000
<u>Look! That child comes running!</u>

00:24:54.800 --> 00:24:59.000
Hora ano ko ga kaketekuru

00:24:59.520 --> 00:25:03.410
<u>With the two baby goats,</u>

00:24:59.520 --> 00:25:03.410
Nihiki no koyagi to issho ni

00:25:04.450 --> 00:25:10.380
<u>In the transparent rays of the sun</u>

00:25:04.450 --> 00:25:10.380
Sukitootta hizashi no naka wo

00:25:11.750 --> 00:25:20.160
<u>If those little footsteps are heard,</u>

00:25:11.750 --> 00:25:20.160
Moshimo chiisana ashioto ga kikoetara

00:25:20.330 --> 00:25:24.370
<u>Wait and see</u>

00:25:20.330 --> 00:25:24.370
Mattete goran

00:25:24.520 --> 00:25:29.010
<u>Look! That child comes running!</u>

00:25:24.520 --> 00:25:29.010
Hora ano ko ga kaketekuru
